																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"719044892364374674","clan_steamid":"103582791474307121","event_name":"Patch 4 is out now!","event_type":28,"appid":2712590,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792663320,"rtime32_end_time":1792666920,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Smarter kitchens, batch cooking, better quest tracking and more!\",null,null,null,null,null,\"\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"742ccfd7de38563e3df021186a35b76dc6869e2d.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"66dcbf7707792ff4e225d8bed66b94264cf67643.png\",null,null,null,null,null,\"3b9fd67aeca22c4ce37e15613246f961086a3dc4.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"719044892364374675","clanid":"44785713","posterid":"0","headline":"Patch 4 is out now!","posttime":1792663372,"updatetime":1792663372,"body":"[p][b]Patch 4 is live! \ud83d\udc9a[\/b][\/p][p][\/p][p]Our fourth patch is here, and it brings a new improvements to the kitchen and beyond. Many of you told us that setting up recipes took too much manual work and that dragons sometimes got confused while cooking, so we've rebuilt a part of how cooking works, along with better quest tracking, save fixes and smoother farm interactions. Thank you for every review, bug report and Discord message, this patch is a direct result of your feedback.[\/p][p][\/p][p]Here's what's new:[\/p][p][b]\ud83c\udf73 New kitchen orders[\/b][\/p][p]Choosing what to cook is now much simpler. Select a recipe or order, choose how many you want and add it to your list. We've also updated controller navigation and ingredient counters in the kitchen.[\/p][p][b]\ud83e\uddfa Automatic kitchen setup[\/b][\/p][p]Both hot and cold kitchens now automatically move ingredients from kitchen storage into the right baskets for your active orders. You can also lock baskets to keep them assigned, and items swap neatly when storage is full.[\/p][p][b]\ud83d\udc09 Smarter dragons in the kitchen[\/b][\/p][p]We've reworked how cooking, item transfers and dragon assignments work behind the scenes, so dragons should handle interruptions much better and get stuck far less often. Going to sleep now waits for your dragons to finish up in the kitchen, and they no longer carry ingredients or tableware back to the wrong place.[\/p][p][b]\ud83e\udded Quest tracking improvements[\/b][\/p][p]You can now track and untrack main quests yourself. You can track up to 5 quests at once, and your choices are saved.[\/p][p][b]\ud83d\udcdc Quest progression fixes[\/b][\/p][p]The Alchemist, Animal Keeper and Weaver storages now appear through their arrival quests, and resource bubbles in a couple of quest stages now update correctly once you've delivered items.[\/p][p][b]\ud83d\udcbe Save fixes[\/b][\/p][p]We've improved the save system, and older saves now automatically recover misplaced Alchemist quest objects on the farm, as well as missing scenery and quest progress.[\/p][p][b]\ud83c\udfb5 Small touches[\/b][\/p][p]A new music box sound and effect, updated flute control labels and some text fixes.[\/p][p][b]\ud83d\udc1b Bug fixes[\/b][\/p][p]We've fixed several issues that could cause errors or make interactions unresponsive.[\/p][p][b]\ud83d\udd27 What's next[\/b][\/p][p]Four patches in, and we're still going. We're already working on what comes next, so keep telling us what you'd like to see improved \ud83d\ude4f[\/p][p][b]\ud83d\udcac Keep the feedback coming[\/b][\/p][p][\/p][p]If you haven't played in a while, it's a good time to jump back in and try the new kitchen setup. Also if you run into a bug, the best place to report it is our Discord.[\/p][p][\/p][p]Thank you for cooking, farming and growing with us, Dragon Keepers. Every fix in this patch started with one of you telling us what wasn't working, and we're so grateful for that. \ud83d\udc09[\/p][p][\/p][p]Wild Forest Studio & Curve Games[\/p][p][\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/44785713\/d9af6eb2221a4532f1d7a78b16dcddaf7398b3ea.png\"][\/img][\/p]","commentcount":11,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1434278705_1792664062_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"562545439722867721","event_gid":"719044892364374674","voteupcount":117,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"562545439722867721","rtime32_last_modified":1793544022,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792664062,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792077504,"votes_up":117,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"4039229582008672495","gidfeature2":"562545439722867721"},{"gid":"704407559937722959","clan_steamid":"103582791474307121","event_name":"Dragon Shelter \u2014 Updates Roadmap","event_type":28,"appid":2712590,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1791558300,"rtime32_end_time":1791561600,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"10c2fd40e5688766d6eff4298d787b982b53122f.png\",null,null,null,null,null,\"10c2fd40e5688766d6eff4298d787b982b53122f.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"1fb8a579911e57bab701f413c534324a35d6f8b1.png\",null,null,null,null,null,\"5075001aee0fc2a744a8dc4e75346f392375b954.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"704407559937722960","clanid":"44785713","posterid":"0","headline":"Dragon Shelter \u2014 Updates Roadmap","posttime":1791558310,"updatetime":1791558310,"body":"[h3][b]The road ahead for Dragon Shelter \ud83d\udc09[\/b][\/h3][p][\/p][p]Thank you for every review, bug report and message you've sent us since launch. Your feedback has already shaped our first patches, and it's shaping everything that comes next.[\/p][p][\/p][p]Here's a look at what we're working on and planning for Dragon Shelter. This isn't a schedule, and some things may change as we go, but it's the direction we're heading in.[\/p][p][\/p][h3][b]\ud83c\udfa3 Fishing[\/b][\/h3][p]Fishing is getting some well deserved love. We want it to feel like a relaxing, rewarding part of your day on the farm.[\/p][h3][b]\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udca7 New elemental dragon abilities[\/b][\/h3][p]Your dragons will grow into even better companions, with more unique ways to use their elemental powers around the farm and through the changing seasons.[\/p][h3][b]\ud83e\uddf0 Tools and farm life[\/b][\/h3][p]More ways to grow your toolkit, including tool progression and new tools to make farm work smoother, plus improvements to everyday tasks like keeping your watering can and kitchen water topped up.[\/p][h3][b]\ud83c\udf72 Cooking and the kitchen[\/b][\/h3][p]New kitchen stations and recipes, smarter kitchen workflows that take some of the manual setup off your hands, and new ways to teach your dragons recipes. We're also exploring food that gives you different helpful effects.[\/p][h3][b]\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f Days, weather and seasons[\/b][\/h3][p]A nicer end of day moment that shows how your day went and what's ahead, along with updated weather that gives each season more character and new ways to prepare for it.[\/p][h3][b]\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f A cozier town[\/b][\/h3][p]We're reworking parts of the town to make it easier and more pleasant to get around, with important places closer to where you need them. And as you help the townsfolk and bring the community back to life, you'll see the town transform into a restored, brighter place.[\/p][h3][b]\u2728 More to do after the main story[\/b][\/h3][p]New content for when you've wrapped up the main quest line, so there's always something waiting for you on the farm.[\/p][h3][b]\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Museum, achievements and collections[\/b][\/h3][p]New museum collections, new achievements and more things to discover and collect.[\/p][h3][b]\ud83c\udfb4 Steam extras[\/b][\/h3][p]Trading cards and Points Shop items, so you can bring a bit of Dragon Shelter to your Steam profile.[\/p][h3][b]\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Quality of life[\/b][\/h3][p]Ongoing quality of life improvements based on your feedback, from UI and UX polish to better readability and font sizes, plus lots of small changes that add up.[\/p][h3][b]\ud83c\udfa8 Visuals and settings[\/b][\/h3][p]Continued visual polish and more settings so you can tune the game to your setup.[\/p][h3][b]\ud83c\udf0d New languages[\/b][\/h3][p]More localizations are on the way. We want each one to be spot on in quality and stability before it goes live.[\/p][h3][b]\ud83c\udfae More platforms[\/b][\/h3][p]We'd love for even more players to meet our dragons, and we're exploring bringing Dragon Shelter to more platforms in the future.[\/p][hr][\/hr][p][\/p][p]We'll share more about each of these as they get closer. Until then, keep the feedback coming on Steam and Discord, it really helps us decide what to focus on.[\/p][p][\/p][p]Thank you for being part of Dragon Shelter's journey, Dragon Keepers \ud83d\udc9a[\/p][p]Wild Forest Studio & Curve Games[\/p]","commentcount":9,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1607812438_1791561651_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"590691913363883181","event_gid":"704407559937722959","voteupcount":168,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"590691913363883181","rtime32_last_modified":1793477179,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1791561652,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1791553584,"votes_up":168,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"4039229582008672495","gidfeature2":"590691913363883181"},{"gid":"695399094121662345","clan_steamid":"103582791474307121","event_name":"We hear you: Patch 1 is coming very soon","event_type":13,"appid":2712590,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1790611680,"rtime32_end_time":1790616601,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"17bdf01130d61af1b11ad0b7db8c415764db8290.png\",null,null,null,null,null,\"17bdf01130d61af1b11ad0b7db8c415764db8290.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"04933b5c7fb2df387c2b43c907d1d1b82c39efa1.png\",null,null,null,null,null,\"58532f1531ac4b909ea0076ffd3a22c1d7b5fd50.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"695399094121662346","clanid":"44785713","posterid":"0","headline":"We hear you: Patch 1 is coming very soon","posttime":1790611736,"updatetime":1790676748,"body":"[p]Thank you for all your feedback \ud83d\udc9a[\/p][p][\/p][p]It's been a few days since Dragon Shelter launched, and we want to say a huge thank you to everyone who has played, left a review, joined our Discord or sent us a bug report. Seeing so many of you explore the world, adopt your first dragons and share your farms has meant a lot to our team.[\/p][p]We've also been reading every review and every message, and we want to be honest with you: we know Dragon Shelter has a number of issues right now. Many of you told us there's too much running around town, that progression can feel slow and grindy, that seasons and some mechanics aren't explained well enough, and that bugs sometimes get in the way. That feedback is fair, and we're taking it seriously. Our first patch is almost ready and focuses on the issues you've raised the most. We'll share the full changelog as soon as the patch is live.[\/p][p][\/p][p][b]\ud83d\udca1 A few tips from your feedback[\/b][\/p][p]Some things were already in the game but clearly weren't explained well enough, and that's on us:[\/p][list][*][p]Tooltips: hover over any item with the mouse, or press RS on controller.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Moving buildings: you can demolish any building on your farm with the hammer and place it again, including your kitchen.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Running out of wood or other resources? The forest behind town always has them, and trees and other resources respawn there every 3 to 5 days.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Buying the wrong item with a controller? This is an issue with some controllers right now and we're working on a fix. For now, you can try fixing it through Steam Input.[\/p][\/*][*][p][\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]\ud83c\udf31 And we're not stopping there[\/b][\/p][p]Patch 1 is just the first step. We're already working on more improvements after it, including key rebinding, better controller support, clearer icons, extra info about resources in the Journal and many more QoL improvements.[\/p][p][\/p][p][b]\ud83d\udcac Keep the feedback coming[\/b][\/p][p]If you run into a bug, the best place to report it is our Discord. It really helps us track things down faster.[\/p][p]Thank you for sticking with us, Dragon Keepers. This is just the start of Dragon Shelter's journey, and we're committed to making it the cozy, relaxing game it's meant to be. \ud83d\udc09[\/p][p][\/p][p]Wild Forest Studio & Curve Games[\/p]","commentcount":25,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1889321037_1790615142_0","ModAct_1434278705_1790677568_4"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"591816596100720923","event_gid":"695399094121662345","voteupcount":200,"votedowncount":2,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"591816596100720923","rtime32_last_modified":1792018348,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1790677568,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1790606820,"votes_up":200,"votes_down":2,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"4039229582008672495","gidfeature2":"591816596100720923"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["719044892364374675","704407559937722960"],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1790611680,"event_gid":"695399094121662345","announcement_gid":"695399094121662346","clan_account_id":44785713}}};
						</script>
					

					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				

					<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="game_area_reviews" class="game_area_description">
						<h2>Reviews</h2>
												<p>“Dragon Shelter is a cozy take on Skyrim you'll fall in love with”<br><a href="https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gamingbible.com%2Fnews%2Fanimal-crossing-free-steam-alternative-072508-20260505" target="_blank" rel=" noopener"  >GAMINGbible</a><br><br>“It's just dragons and vibes, but they are good vibes”<br><a href="https://www.pcgamer.com/games/life-sim/14-days-in-dragon-shelter-a-play-by-play-of-my-first-season-in-the-stardew-style-farm-sim-where-dragons-help-bake-pies/" target="_blank" rel=""  >PC Gamer </a><br></p>
					</div>
				
								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >Join a heartfelt adventure where friendship, care, and hard work restore harmony to a forgotten world. Rebuild the lost bond between humans and dragons as you transform abandoned lands into a place filled with warmth and joy. Grow crops, gather resources, raise adorable dragons, and help townsfolk rediscover their happiness.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/21659790be34b800cd53af9310deb40a.poster.avif?t=1790354685" width=1170 height=804 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/21659790be34b800cd53af9310deb40a.webm?t=1790354685" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/21659790be34b800cd53af9310deb40a.mp4?t=1790354685" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" > </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Befriend cheerful dragons, each with unique traits and special powers that assist you on the farm and beyond. Care for them with love and playtime, and they’ll become loyal companions who sense people’s needs and lend their magic wherever it’s needed.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" > </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/f2fac1576c21723cf6d43b84fde167ba.poster.avif?t=1790354685" width=1170 height=804 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/f2fac1576c21723cf6d43b84fde167ba.webm?t=1790354685" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/f2fac1576c21723cf6d43b84fde167ba.mp4?t=1790354685" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Rebuild your grandpa’s abandoned farm into a thriving sanctuary. Grow crops, harvest resources, and craft valuable goods while your dragon helpers support every step. Watch the land come back to life as your care turns a forgotten place into a haven of joy.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/72532327f9f73aad27517d35f6bcbeb4.poster.avif?t=1790354685" width=1170 height=804 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/72532327f9f73aad27517d35f6bcbeb4.webm?t=1790354685" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/72532327f9f73aad27517d35f6bcbeb4.mp4?t=1790354685" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Cooking is the heart of crafting in Dragon Shelter. Meals strengthen bonds with neighbors, lift spirits, and unlock new opportunities. Every harvest can be used in cooking, crafting, alchemy, or trade – making each recipe meaningful and rewarding. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/be649fbcc8e734027c2d62020399148f.poster.avif?t=1790354685" width=1170 height=804 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/be649fbcc8e734027c2d62020399148f.webm?t=1790354685" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/be649fbcc8e734027c2d62020399148f.mp4?t=1790354685" type="video/mp4"></video></span> </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >A nearby town has fallen into gloom, but hope remains. With the help of your dragons, reconnect with the townsfolk, uncover their stories, and rekindle their sense of joy and community.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/5d7489c57ac44040f50f0682a7a06fff.poster.avif?t=1790354685" width=1170 height=804 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/5d7489c57ac44040f50f0682a7a06fff.webm?t=1790354685" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712590/extras/5d7489c57ac44040f50f0682a7a06fff.mp4?t=1790354685" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Venture into a vibrant fantasy world filled with magical biomes, curious creatures, and hidden secrets. Every journey offers delightful surprises and the chance to restore life to forgotten lands.</p>						</div>
					</div>
